Its filed 1,155 **undercounts** it: that census requires an accessor hop and structurally excludes ~1,110 direct instance writes on the same fields. And `__init__` was declined despite the build note asking for it, on data — 1 class, 1 field, 0 chain sites on pretix. Worth testing because an `__init__` population would live in application code and be visible on the default arm, which would have changed the framing.

